================================================================================
PRIVACY
================================================================================

PerfScope sends anonymous usage statistics through bStats (project ID 35061).
The plugin does not upload player names, world names, coordinates, chat
content, plugin lists, configuration file contents, alert text, or server
addresses. Reporting can be disabled in plugins/bStats/config.yml or via
general.bstats-enabled: false in this plugin's config.yml.

See the README for the full two-layer disclosure (what the bStats library
itself reports vs. what this plugin reports).
